@dragon-talon/dsh-openspec README · @dragon-talon/dsh-openspec：- 12 canonical `openspec-*` skills (model- **and** user-invocable)
- 12 `/opsx-<id>` command aliases (user-only, content-identical to their canonical skill)
- No runtime state: skills are registered through DSH's skill registry, which owns uniqueness and lifecycle

@dragon-talon/dsh-openspec README · Usage：Once registered, both forms are available in DSH:

- Canonical: `/openspec-new-change`, `/openspec-apply-change`, …
- Aliases: `/opsx-new`, `/opsx-apply`, … (resolve to the same body)

@dragon-talon/dsh-openspec README · @dragon-talon/dsh-openspec：- 12 个规范 `openspec-*` 技能(模型 **和** 用户均可调用)
- 12 个 `/opsx-<id>` 命令别名(仅用户可调用,内容与其规范技能一致)
- 无运行时状态:技能通过 DSH 的技能注册表登记,唯一性与生命周期由注册表负责

@dragon-talon/dsh-openspec README · 使用：注册后,两种形式在 DSH 中均可用:

- 规范形式:`/openspec-new-change`、`/openspec-apply-change` …
- 别名形式:`/opsx-new`、`/opsx-apply` …(解析到相同正文)
